<title>USA: GOLF-SECOND ROUND LEADERS AT BUICK CLASSIC.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SECOND ROUND LEADERS AT BUICK CLASSIC.</headline>
<dateline>HARRISON, New York 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leaders after the</p>
<p>second round of the $1.5 million Buick Classic golf tournament</p>
<p>at Westchester Country Club on Friday (U.S. unless stated):</p>
<p>132 Ernie Els (South Africa) 64 68</p>
<p>135 Jim Furyk 67 68</p>
<p>136 Brad Fabel 69 67, Jeff Maggert 67 69</p>
<p>137 Peter Jordan 69 68, Bob Tway 70 67, Robert Damron 71 66,</p>
<p>Robin Freeman 70 67</p>
<p>138 Tom Byrum 71 67, Bob Estes 71 67, Rafael Alarcon (Mexico)</p>
<p>69 69, Clarence Rose 69 69, Mark Calcavecchia 71 67</p>
<p>139 Fred Funk 69 70, Jim Carter 69 70, Rocco Mediate 73 66,</p>
<p>Mike Reid 70 69, Frank Nobilo (New Zealand) 70 69, Billy Ray</p>
<p>Brown 72 67</p>
<p>140 Brad Faxon 66 74, Allen Doyle 71 69, Jeff Sluman 70 70,</p>
<p>Vijay Singh (Fiji) 67 73, Nolan Henke 72 68</p>
<p>Other international players</p>
<p>142 Bradley Hughes (Australia) 70 72</p>
<p>143 Stuart Appleby (Australia) 70 73, Craig Parry (Australia)</p>
<p>70 73</p>
<p>144 Fulton Allem (South Africa) 72 72, Steve Elkington</p>
<p>(Australia) 74 70, Gabriel Hjertstedt (Sweden) 73 71</p>
<p>145 David Frost (South Africa) 78 67, Phil Tataurangi (New</p>
<p>Zealand) 74 71</p>
<p>148 Hideki Kase (Japan) 72 76</p>
<p>dq Grant Waite (New Zealand) 76 disqualified</p>
